hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"196","Subḥānaka Allāhumma wa bi-ḥamdika, ashadu an lā ilāha illā anta, astaghfirūka wa atūbu ilayk.. Glory be to You, O Allah, and praise be to You. I bear witness that there is no god but You. I seek Your forgiveness and repent to You."
"197","Wa laka. And for You (belongs all praise)"
